        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<p><em><strong>The maps showed the changes in a city centre from the year 2000 to the present day. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></p>",
        "sort": 1,
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Nelson city from 2000 to now</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Đề b&agrave;i Nelson city from 2000 to now y&ecirc;u cầu th&iacute; sinh m&ocirc; tả&nbsp;những thay đổi đ&atilde; diễn ra tại trung t&acirc;m th&agrave;nh phố Nelson bằng c&aacute;ch so s&aacute;nh hai bản đồ: một bản đồ của năm 2000 v&agrave; một bản đồ của thời điểm hiện tại.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-KGfkdvXnMo9tBVxWubvlf0gagVh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOoQd6oJTo25Hhxi84tlE4FPgnb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Paraphrase đề Nelson city from 2000 to now với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOoQd6oJTo25Hhxi84tlE4FPgnb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<ul>\n<li>Những thay đổi lớn tại trung t&acirc;m th&agrave;nh phố Nelson</li>\n<li>Trong khoảng thời gian từ năm 2000 đến nay</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U7iadbsa0o9CMOxYDBClUkAhgse\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề map, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ tập trung n&oacute;i về c&aacute;c sự thay đổi ch&iacute;nh. Cụ thể với đề Nelson city from 2000 to now, ch&uacute;ng ta sẽ n&oacute;i về những thay đổi sau:\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F17bd2dZ4oRxc8x2o3zlmdHCgcs\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Khu vực đ&atilde; trải qua một cuộc <strong>t&aacute;i ph&aacute;t triển s&acirc;u rộng</strong> <em>(extensive redevelopment)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CC5KdmHzQovbyYxVgCBl8EbYgbi\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>C&oacute; sự bổ sung nhiều tiện &iacute;ch mới về thương mại, nh&agrave; ở v&agrave; giải tr&iacute;.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J1PodoAamoLYgzxanZzlJEYcgQf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Cơ sở hạ tầng giao th&ocirc;ng được cải thiện đ&aacute;ng kể, đặc biệt l&agrave; việc ưu ti&ecirc;n cho người đi bộ.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i Nelson city from 2000 to now<em>&nbsp;</em>một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c chi tiết dựa tr&ecirc;n ti&ecirc;u ch&iacute; <strong>t&igrave;nh trạng cũ v&agrave; mới.</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FKLxd8T0jomlW3xlEQ5lfJGxgwb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1: Khu vực ph&iacute;a Bắc v&agrave; thay đổi giao th&ocirc;ng</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xz8Sd3833oJVsmxgnsUlprJUgUb\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UT5vdzdrJoaohpxHYDDlBrfugPA\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>(Step 1)</strong> M&ocirc; tả việc di dời <em>(relocate)</em> Ga t&agrave;u<em> (Train Station)</em> từ ph&iacute;a T&acirc;y v&agrave;o vị tr&iacute; trung t&acirc;m hơn<em> (a more central location).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZzNxdjoFwo0ytdxk8Cul9e6ugxh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>(Step 2)</strong> Đề cập đến việc x&acirc;y dựng<em> (construct)</em> K&yacute; t&uacute;c x&aacute;<em> (Hall of Residence) </em>mới ở ph&iacute;a T&acirc;y của trường Đại học <em>(University)</em>, trong khi trường đại học vẫn giữ nguy&ecirc;n vị tr&iacute;<em> (remains unchanged)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WMlBdJZdzoRJf8xDnu7l2VB3gNv\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>(Step 3)</strong> Chỉ ra sự thay đổi ở ph&iacute;a Đ&ocirc;ng Bắc: khu c&acirc;y xanh đ&atilde; bị dỡ bỏ để x&acirc;y dựng<em> (have been removed to make way for) </em>một Trung t&acirc;m mua sắm mới <em>(New Shopping Centre).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RLY8dqlWtogQQLxKXhclOn0Ughe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>(Step 4)</strong> Nhắc đến việc thiết lập <em>(establish) </em>một vạch sang đường cho người đi bộ, kết nối trường đại học với khu vực trung t&acirc;m.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P28wdkqCxoxJzCxhGfIlLa1cgwd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2:</strong><strong> Khu vực trung t&acirc;m v&agrave; ph&iacute;a Nam</strong></span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OrA9dgGjNoRCVUxfgJ1lOWFlglh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>,&nbsp; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YXHKdjRgQoCrIcxwoPil4skxg9b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>(Step 1)</strong> M&ocirc; tả khu vực \"City Centre\" trống trước đ&acirc;y đ&atilde; được ph&aacute;t triển th&agrave;nh<em> (has been developed into)</em> một dịch vụ cho thu&ecirc; xe đạp<em> (Bike Rental Scheme).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WDobdzkEYo764ZxkS3aliXJ1gZc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>(Step 2)</strong> N&ecirc;u chi tiết sự thay đổi ở ph&iacute;a T&acirc;y Nam: khu Chợ cũ<em> (Old Market)</em> bị ph&aacute; bỏ <em>(demolished)</em> v&agrave; thay thế bằng một Cửa h&agrave;ng mới<em> (New Shop)</em> v&agrave; một khu Chợ c&oacute; m&aacute;i che mới <em>(New Covered Market).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DEepdOYijobsn5xuAR8lbkMkgvm\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>(Step 3)</strong> Giải th&iacute;ch con đường ở ph&iacute;a Nam đ&atilde; được chuyển đổi<em> (has been converted into)</em> từ đường cho xe cộ th&agrave;nh phố đi bộ <em>(pedestrian-only zone).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DdqTdw9BWotLW1xyPqFlQ3rcg5g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>(Step 4)</strong> Liệt k&ecirc; c&aacute;c cơ sở kinh doanh mới xuất hiện<em> (emerged)</em> dọc theo phố đi bộ n&agrave;y: một Nh&agrave; h&agrave;ng <em>(Restaurant)</em> ở ph&iacute;a T&acirc;y Nam v&agrave; c&aacute;c Qu&aacute;n bar v&agrave; c&acirc;u lạc bộ <em>(Bars and Clubs)</em> ở ph&iacute;a Đ&ocirc;ng Nam.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OlkGdEEVgoL3lnx1uHSlV8gQg9b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>(Step 5)</strong> Khẳng định lại rằng Cảng (Port) vẫn giữ nguy&ecirc;n vị tr&iacute; ban đầu <em>(continues to operate in its original location) </em>ở ph&iacute;a Đ&ocirc;ng Nam.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
